values ($q$cinema$q$, 50, true, $q$Kino Hviezda$q$, $q$Hviezda Cinema$q$,
        ($q$"Malé kino Hviezda v Trnave predáva lístky v pokladni a chce prestať zapisovať rezervácie na papier. Každé sedadlo má kód, napríklad A1, a kategóriu, vip alebo standard. Každý divák má meno a e-mail a pokladníčka musí vedieť, kto si rezervoval ktoré sedadlo.\n\nPokladníčka pridá sedadlo príkazom `addseat`, za ktorým nasleduje jeho kód a kategória. Program odpovie `Seat A1 added.`\n\nSedadlo sa rezervuje príkazom `reserve`, za ktorým nasleduje kód sedadla, meno a e-mail diváka. Ak je sedadlo voľné, program odpovie `Seat A1 reserved for Lucia.` Ak je už rezervované, odpovie `Seat A1 is already reserved.` Ak také sedadlo neexistuje, odpovie `Seat Z9 does not exist.`\n\nPríkaz `seat`, za ktorým nasleduje kód sedadla, zobrazí toto jedno sedadlo: `A1 vip free`, ak si ho nikto nerezervoval, alebo `A1 vip reserved for Lucia`, ak áno. Ak také sedadlo neexistuje, vypíše `Seat Z9 does not exist.`\n\nProgram číta jeden príkaz na riadok a skončí príkazom `exit`. Každá hodnota v príkaze je jedno slovo. Okrem uvedených odpovedí program nevypisuje nič – žiadne menu, uvítanie ani výzvy na zadanie. Odpovede píš presne tak, ako sú uvedené (po anglicky)."$q$::jsonb #>> '{}'),
        ($q$"The small Hviezda Cinema in Trnava sells tickets at the box office and wants to stop writing reservations on paper. Every seat has a code, like A1, and a category, vip or standard. Every viewer has a name and an email, and the cashier must know who has reserved which seat.\n\nThe cashier adds a seat with the command `addseat`, followed by its code and category. The program replies `Seat A1 added.`\n\nA seat is reserved with `reserve`, followed by the seat code, the viewer's name and email. If the seat is free, the program replies `Seat A1 reserved for Lucia.` If it is already reserved, it replies `Seat A1 is already reserved.` If there is no such seat, it replies `Seat Z9 does not exist.`\n\nThe command `seat`, followed by a seat code, shows that one seat: `A1 vip free` if nobody has reserved it, or `A1 vip reserved for Lucia` if somebody has. If there is no such seat, it prints `Seat Z9 does not exist.`\n\nThe program reads one command per line and ends with the command `exit`. Every value in a command is a single word. Apart from the replies above, the program prints nothing – no menu, no welcome text, no prompts."$q$::jsonb #>> '{}'),
        100, 3000,
        $q$[{"name_sk":"Pridanie sedadla","name_en":"Adding a seat","input":"addseat A1 vip\naddseat A2 standard\nexit\n","expected":"Seat A1 added.\nSeat A2 added.\n","points":15},{"name_sk":"Rezervácia voľného sedadla priradí diváka","name_en":"Reserving a free seat assigns the viewer","input":"addseat A1 vip\naddseat A2 standard\nreserve A2 Lucia lucia@mail.sk\nseat A2\nseat A1\nexit\n","expected":"Seat A1 added.\nSeat A2 added.\nSeat A2 reserved for Lucia.\nA2 standard reserved for Lucia\nA1 vip free\n","points":25},{"name_sk":"Rezervácia obsadeného sedadla zlyhá","name_en":"Reserving a seat that is already reserved fails","input":"addseat A1 vip\nreserve A1 Lucia lucia@mail.sk\nreserve A1 Juraj juraj@mail.sk\nseat A1\nexit\n","expected":"Seat A1 added.\nSeat A1 reserved for Lucia.\nSeat A1 is already reserved.\nA1 vip reserved for Lucia\n","points":20},{"name_sk":"Výpis sedadla je presný","name_en":"Showing a seat is exact","input":"addseat A1 vip\naddseat B5 standard\nseat B5\nreserve B5 Juraj juraj@mail.sk\nseat B5\nseat A1\nseat C3\nexit\n","expected":"Seat A1 added.\nSeat B5 added.\nB5 standard free\nSeat B5 reserved for Juraj.\nB5 standard reserved for Juraj\nA1 vip free\nSeat C3 does not exist.\n","points":25},{"name_sk":"Rezervácia neexistujúceho sedadla zlyhá","name_en":"Reserving a seat that does not exist fails","input":"addseat A1 vip\nreserve Z9 Lucia lucia@mail.sk\nseat A1\nexit\n","expected":"Seat A1 added.\nSeat Z9 does not exist.\nA1 vip free\n","points":15}]$q$::jsonb,
        $q${"classes":[{"name":"Seat","role":"item","properties":["string Code","string Category","Viewer? Viewer","bool IsFree (Viewer == null)"]},{"name":"Viewer","role":"person","properties":["string Name","string Email"]},{"name":"Cinema","role":"manager","properties":["string Name","List<Seat> Seats"],"operations":["AddSeat(code, category)","Reserve(code, viewer)","FindSeat(code)"]}],"link":"Seat.Viewer → Viewer (one-way: the seat knows who reserved it)","storage":"List<Seat> in Cinema"}$q$::jsonb,
        ($q$"// Reference solution – Hviezda Cinema. Hidden from students; used to validate the scenarios.\nvar cinema = new Cinema(\"Hviezda\");\n\nwhile (true)\n{\n    string? line = Console.ReadLine();\n    if (line == null) break;\n    string[] parts = line.Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries);\n    if (parts.Length == 0) continue;\n\n    string command = parts[0].ToLower();\n    if (command == \"exit\") break;\n\n    if (command == \"addseat\")\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine(cinema.AddSeat(parts[1], parts[2]));\n    }\n    else if (command == \"reserve\")\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine(cinema.Reserve(parts[1], new Viewer(parts[2], parts[3])));\n    }\n    else if (command == \"seat\")\n    {\n        Seat? seat = cinema.FindSeat(parts[1]);\n        if (seat == null) Console.WriteLine($\"Seat {parts[1]} does not exist.\");\n        else if (seat.IsFree) Console.WriteLine($\"{seat.Code} {seat.Category} free\");\n        else Console.WriteLine($\"{seat.Code} {seat.Category} reserved for {seat.Viewer!.Name}\");\n    }\n}\n\nclass Seat\n{\n    public string Code { get; }\n    public string Category { get; }\n    public Viewer? Viewer { get; set; }\n    public bool IsFree => Viewer == null;\n\n    public Seat(string code, string category)\n    {\n        Code = code;\n        Category = category;\n    }\n}\n\nclass Viewer\n{\n    public string Name { get; }\n    public string Email { get; }\n\n    public Viewer(string name, string email)\n    {\n        Name = name;\n        Email = email;\n    }\n}\n\nclass Cinema\n{\n    public string Name { get; }\n    private readonly List<Seat> seats = new List<Seat>();\n\n    public Cinema(string name)\n    {\n        Name = name;\n    }\n\n    public string AddSeat(string code, string category)\n    {\n        seats.Add(new Seat(code, category));\n        return $\"Seat {code} added.\";\n    }\n\n    public string Reserve(string code, Viewer viewer)\n    {\n        Seat? seat = FindSeat(code);\n        if (seat == null) return $\"Seat {code} does not exist.\";\n        if (!seat.IsFree) return $\"Seat {code} is already reserved.\";\n        seat.Viewer = viewer;\n        return $\"Seat {code} reserved for {viewer.Name}.\";\n    }\n\n    public Seat? FindSeat(string code)\n    {\n        return seats.Find(s => s.Code == code);\n    }\n}\n"$q$::jsonb #>> '{}'))
on conflict (slug) do update set
  sort_order = excluded.sort_order, is_active = excluded.is_active,
